-- which forms an observation may identify: those that interconvert, and do so faster than the window
-- the observation takes. The window is data, so the identification is declared and not conventional —
-- this is what InChI does to tautomers by fiat, and what the record cannot state when it does.
ic-within : (A : Type 0) → Interconv A → Nat → A → A → Bool
ic-within A r w a b = and (notb (eqb (r a b) 0)) (leb (r a b) w)
